                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Really sweet lady and great lecturer, but the exam is REALLY difficult.  As much as she says it's not &quot;rote memorization,&quot; be ready to re-read and re-write your notes a LOT before it sinks in.",
